# Impossible arm (log 2026-07-31): the alive leash on the tech champion.
# The AI recalls its attack groups home for 500 ticks per base-zone
# intrusion, and the recall runs before the attack branch. A raider pays
# for each recall with its life; a lurker retreats alive when chased and
# walks back, so two scouts are a standing order for the enemy armies to
# stay home while the heavy economy grows ([[ai-opponent-strategy]]).

